@guide A_Dustwallow
@name Dustwallow Marsh (Theramore)
@faction Alliance
@levels 36-41
@zone Dustwallow Marsh
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Theramore Isle and the updated Dustwallow quest hubs: the deserters, the lighthouse, the Grimtotems and Mudsprocket.
@next Both_Tanaris

fp Theramore
bind Theramore
accept Defias in Dustwallow? | Captain Wymor.
turnin Defias in Dustwallow? | Captain Wymor.
accept Renn McGill
accept Raptor Captor | Sergeant Lukas.
complete Raptor Captor | Bloodfen raptors.
turnin Raptor Captor
accept Prisoners of the Grimtotems
accept Unleash the Raptors
turnin Renn McGill
accept Secondhand Diving Gear
complete Secondhand Diving Gear | Damaged Diving Gear: loot Damaged Diving Gear. Tool Kit drops from Defias Rummager.
turnin Secondhand Diving Gear
accept Recover the Cargo!
complete Recover the Cargo! | Underwater near Renn McGill.
turnin Recover the Cargo!
accept Jaina Must Know
turnin Jaina Must Know | Lady Jaina Proudmoore, top of the tower.
accept Survey Alcaz Island | Escort quest: start it when you are ready to follow.
complete Survey Alcaz Island | Escort: stay close; it fails if the NPC dies.
turnin Survey Alcaz Island
accept Warn Bolvar! [optional]
accept This Old Lighthouse | Sergeant Amelyn.
accept Traitors Among Us | Calia Hastings.
complete Traitors Among Us | Deserters at the Shady Rest Inn ruins.
turnin Traitors Among Us
accept Propaganda War
complete Propaganda War | Deserter camp in the marsh.
turnin Propaganda War
accept Discrediting the Deserters
complete Discrediting the Deserters
turnin Discrediting the Deserters
accept The End of the Deserters
complete The End of the Deserters
turnin The End of the Deserters
accept Inspecting the Ruins | Captain Garran Vimes.
turnin This Old Lighthouse | Babs Fizzletorque at the lighthouse.
accept Thresher Oil
complete Thresher Oil | Young Murk Threshers along the coast.
turnin Thresher Oil
accept Dastardly Denizens of the Deep
complete Dastardly Denizens of the Deep | Murks on the coast.
turnin Dastardly Denizens of the Deep
complete Prisoners of the Grimtotems | Grimtotem camps south.
accept The Apothecary's Letter [optional]
accept Direhorn Raiders [optional]
accept The Zeppelin Crash [optional]
accept The Grimtotem Weapon [optional]
accept The Reagent Thief [optional]
complete The Grimtotem Weapon [optional]
complete Direhorn Raiders [optional]
complete The Zeppelin Crash [optional]
complete The Reagent Thief [optional] | Marsh Venom drops from Darkfang Creeper and Noxious Shredder.
turnin The Reagent Thief [optional]
turnin The Grimtotem Weapon [optional]
turnin The Zeppelin Crash [optional]
turnin Direhorn Raiders [optional]
turnin The Apothecary's Letter [optional] | Andello Porter, at Tabetha's farm.
complete Inspecting the Ruins | Examine the burned-out Shady Rest Inn.
